.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH clone 1  "clone " 
.SH NAME
clone \- Create a same\-repository developer workspace from a remote named reference
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBclone\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREMOTE\fR> <\fIREFERENCE\fR> <\fIDESTINATION\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a same\-repository developer workspace from a remote named reference
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH COLLABORATION
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output structured machine JSON envelope
.TP
<\fIREMOTE\fR>
Configured remote name in the source repository
.TP
<\fIREFERENCE\fR>
Remote named reference to clone (for example, main)
.TP
<\fIDESTINATION\fR>
New destination directory
